        # its own slot inside PrimaryBuildBodyIrForFunction — no shared mutable
        # state touched per-function — so a future parallel worker-per-i scheme
        # (F17 slice4) can populate these without cross-worker races. A single
        # serial reduce pass (PrimaryObjectPlanReduceBodyIrPerIndexMetrics),
        # walking i in ascending order after the whole lowering loop has joined,
        # folds them back into the scalar state.bodyIR* fields above (sum/max/AND/
        # first-non-empty-wins, matching the original in-place semantics exactly
